rallel shaft gearmotors; electric motors, such as synchronous, asynchronous, and synchronous reluctance motors; wheel, and travel and track drives; and transit mixer drives. The company also provides planetary geared, right-angle gearmotors and geared, and parallel shaft gearmotors and geared units; inverters and servo drives; yaw and pitch, and slew drives; precision planetary gearboxes and gearmotors; winch drives; cutter, auger, protection geared, tunnelling, and primary shredding drives; hoist and EOT cranes; jack-up and single screw extruder products; and planetary drives for mobile. Its products are used in agriculture and forestry, biogas, construction, food and beverage, intralogistics, logistics, marine and offshore, metalworking, mining, packaging, recycling, textile, wastewater treatment, wind, and woodworking markets and applications. Bonfiglioli Transmissions Limited was incorporated in 1998 and is headquartered in Kanchipuram, India. Bonfiglioli Transmissions Limited operates as a subsidiary of Bonfiglioli S.P.A.","employees":604,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795774500},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795774500,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Bonfiglioli Transmissions\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Bonfiglioli Transmissions (NSEI:BONFIG) - Stock Analysis","s":"Simply Wall St","d":1795707415,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNV2djUlJUVVJ0NGRnZU16MXN6R2Fma3NRanRpaWt6cHVCa3o0bFZjeHpSVDNMaWNieDhtdDRWbFRJeVFYeTJndmN5a25jbXJQWjVFc1F3bnozMm9PWUlPa2I1WHJsSjJTV09Ob1Z6WVRiS3R5a21ockNNd0U1MmdZTnZYN0VFcTJ3Y2dIbFJQaU5peHM?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Bonfiglioli Transmissions Limited (BONFIG.BO) stock price, news, quote and history","s":"Yahoo Finance Singapore","d":1795691928,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFA0ODdXamlBQU1Mcjd2QmNWSUpsUWFHbkU2SE5na3BybGI4SFBPcWJ1ckYtMFhjeXlPVU1uOVhrdDNGZHBsdUNOREpyNkNSY1NrdDFSTkg3bWY?oc=5","g":[]},{"t